Source: craft-launcher
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), binutils, xz-utils, zstd, desktop-file-utils
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher

Package: craft-launcher
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libvulkan1 | libegl1, libwayland-client0, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxkbcommon0
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers, libegl-mesa0, xdg-desktop-portal
Description: App launcher for the Craft suite
 ArtCraft Launcher: the app launcher for the Craft suite of clean-room
 creative tools.
